    "updated_at": "2020-01-14T10:21:03Z",
    "body": "`line_break.disabled = true` is a workaround for a bug in fish. It doesn't do anything good for shells that don't have this particular bug (which is all shells that aren't fish). Ideally, the bug in fish should be fixed. See https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/739 for details.",
