    "body": "> But I'm not using fish, I'm using macOS 10.15.2's stock zsh\r\n\r\nZsh does not have the bug that fish has. Only fish has that bug. `line_break.disabled = true` is a workaround for the bug in fish. This workaround helps when using fish and is harmful when not using fish. Since you aren't using fish, `line_break.disabled = true` is harming you.",
